            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer St-Arnaud"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This cornbread was awesome and not dry at all. The only thing I changed was I used margarine instead of butter and a heaping tbsp each of the herbs in dry form because that's what I had. This was so moist and full of flavor. It's now my favorite cornbread recipe.",
